  "summary": "Malicious code in fieldbase-webapplication-buildtools (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall and install hooks run on installation. They base64-encode the current username, hostname, working directory, and package name, then POST that data to hxxps://eoy34oyrep9j5x8[.]m[.]pipedream[.]net/\u003cencoded-data\u003e via curl. The hooks also perform a DNS lookup exfiltration channel by base64-encoding the package name and resolving it as a subdomain of eoy34oyrep9j5x8[.]m[.]pipedream[.]net via nslookup. The package ships an empty index.js; all behaviour is in the install lifecycle scripts.",
